# ── Meta (Facebook) Pixel ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set this in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# (Production + Preview). Redeploy after saving.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_META_PIXEL_ID is preferred (same name as Next.js apps).
# META_PIXEL_ID also works (read only by /api/meta-config).
NEXT_PUBLIC_META_PIXEL_ID=
# META_PIXEL_ID=

# Optional local override without Vercel API:
# In browser console or a one-off script: window.META_PIXEL_ID = '1234567890'

# ── Testing ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Install Chrome extension "Meta Pixel Helper"
# 2. Open https://mahoneydigital.net/ — Helper should show Pixel + PageView
# 3. Open /contact — PageView only (NO Lead)
# 4. Submit the form successfully → land on /thank-you — Lead + PageView
# 5. Events Manager → Test Events (optional) with your browser open
